<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr ups warrants on utilities basket.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr ups warrants on utilities basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W I Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Thursday it issued an additional 100 million American style call warrants on a basket of utilities stocks, bringing the total issue size to 400 million warrants.</p>
<p>Terms remained unchanged.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd	   0.139 shares</p>
<p> Hong Kong &amp; China Gas Co Ltd	 0.404 shares</p>
<p> Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd     0.194 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$16.775	 PREMIUM	 8.91 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.352	  GEARING	 5.3x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   17.JUN.98	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$18.639</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
